Package: keyringd
Version: @PACKAGE_VERSION@
Architecture: amd64
Section: net
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Keyringd maintainers <info@keyringd.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/keyringd/keyringd
Depends: @SHLIB_DEPENDENCIES@init-system-helpers (>= 1.61), passwd, pkexec
Conflicts: keyringd-wsl
Description: Native Linux desktop passkey-backed SSH agent
 Keyringd protects device keys with the Linux TPM and manages passkey
 credentials through FIDO authenticators.
